The B's are a beartrap that you bring with you.  The @'s are where you
stand while killing the bad guys coming through each respective door.
The ^ is the portal you come through.

The beauty of this is that you can't be shot with missiles while
whomping on the monster caught in the traps.  You can also easily
retreat to heal up mid fight.

